OL,3,GNEWSAEngineer aims to lift world
OL,4,Astrongman title
OL,5,
OL,6,F"When I got the email [about
OL,7,Frepresenting England], I couldn't
OL,8,Fbelieve it. I'm still shocked that I've
OL,9,Fbeen invited to it," said Merry.
